{"version":1,"content":"<p><strong>政府擬修例規管夾公仔機及彈珠機店　麥美娟：學校或餐廳以非業務形式擺夾公仔機不需領牌</strong></p><p>・政府擬修例規管夾公仔機及彈珠機店　麥美娟：學校或餐廳以非業務形式擺夾公仔機不需領牌</p><p>暫時未能從明報 本地擷取全文。</p><p><a href=\"https://news.mingpao.com/ins/%e6%b8%af%e8%81%9e/article/20260511/s00001/1778498970961/%e6%94%bf%e5%ba%9c%e6%93%ac%e4%bf%ae%e4%be%8b%e8%a6%8f%e7%ae%a1%e5%a4%be%e5%85%ac%e4%bb%94%e6%a9%9f%e5%8f%8a%e5%bd%88%e7%8f%a0%e6%a9%9f%e5%ba%97-%e9%ba%a5%e7%be%8e%e5%a8%9f-%e5%ad%b8%e6%a0%a1%e6%88%96%e9%a4%90%e5%bb%b3%e4%bb%a5%e9%9d%9e%e6%a5%ad%e5%8b%99%e5%bd%a2%e5%bc%8f%e6%93%ba%e5%a4%be%e5%85%ac%e4%bb%94%e6%a9%9f%e4%b8%8d%e9%9c%80%e9%a0%98%e7%89%8c\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">閱讀原文</a></p>","scraped_at":"2026-05-12T04:19:22.128845+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":105,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"minimal"}}